  "system": {
    "description": "<section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block scrpg-archetype-block-intro\"><p>No one knows what you will do next — not the bad guys, not your allies, sometimes not even you.</p></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Powers/Qualities</div><p>Assign one or more of the dice you rolled at the end of the power source step to any of these powers:</p><p>• @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.powers.Item.hQIArnjTuOBxYoPT]{Signature Vehicle}</p><p>• @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.powers.Item.fubw8CJu2mXFZJUD]{Signature Weaponry}</p><p>• Select from Athletic powers category</p><p>• Select from Intellectual powers category</p><p>• Select from Mobility powers category</p><p>• Select from Self Control powers category</p><p>Assign any remaining dice to any of these qualities:</p><p>• Select from Physical qualities category</p><p>• Select from Social qualities category</p></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Abilities</div><p>Gain two of the following Green abilities, using two different powers.</p><ul class=\"scrpg-archetype-ability-links\"><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.gVS9lWj9vrPl0pav]{Gimmick}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.sCjlYDhbpB2fyvPF]{Multitask}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.8V23QLdMhaMm1ksS]{Surprise Results}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.qgqw2F9QUFw2cEXX]{Unknown Results}</li></ul><p>Gain one of these Yellow abilities.</p><ul class=\"scrpg-archetype-ability-links\"><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.U6J8qnDm39ZC3XjQ]{Break the 4th}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.4ffkFBRSra05lBgh]{Danger!}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.5iCtwVnOWCIUYHJa]{Expect the Unexpected}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.gOk1W0UUUxEuBTjr]{Imitation}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.DilWGdPZKMElZzh5]{Turn the Tables}</li></ul></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Principle</div><p>Choose an Ideals principle.</p></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Personality</div><p>Roll d10, d10 for personality selection.</p></section>"
